  "job_B1.3.8_20251001_193225": {
    "text": "XII KALENDAS FEBRUARIAS NATALE SANCTE AGNETIS UIRGINIS.\nAMBROSIVS BISCEOP BINNAN MEDIOLANA afunde on ealdum bocum be \u00f0\u00e6re eadigan Agne, hu\n\u00d0a awrat Ambrosius be \u00feam m\u00e6dene \u00f0us.\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re tide w\u00e6s sum \u00e6\u00f0elboren m\u00e6den Agnes gehaten, on \u00f0one H\u00e6lend gelyfed, binnan Rome byrig,\nSeo wan \u00feurh geleafan wi\u00f0 \u00fea feondlican ealdras, and on \u00f0am \u00feritteo\u00f0an geara \u00feone dea\u00f0 forleas and\nHeo w\u00e6s wlitig on ansyne, and wlitigre on geleafan.\n\u00dea \u00f0a heo gewende of scole, \u00f0a awogode hi sum cniht, Simpronies sunu, \u00fee w\u00e6s geset ofer \u00f0a burh to\n\u00dea budon \u00f0a magas \u00feam m\u00e6dene sona deorwur\u00f0e gyrlan, and deorwur\u00f0ran beheton, ac seo eadige\n\u00d0a brohte se cniht to \u00f0am cl\u00e6nan m\u00e6dene deorwur\u00f0a gimmas and woruldlice glencga, and behet hire\n\u00dea andwyrde Agnes anr\u00e6dlice \u00feam cnihte, Gewit \u00f0u fram me synne ontendnys, leahtras foda, and\nIc h\u00e6bbe o\u00f0erne lufiend, \u00feinne ungelican on \u00e6\u00f0elborennysse, se\u00f0e me bead b\u00e6teran fr\u00e6tegunga, and\nHe befeng minne swi\u00f0ran and eac minne swuran mid deorwur\u00f0um stanum and mid scinendum\nHe gesette his tacn on minum nebbe \u00fe\u00e6t ic n\u00e6nne o\u00f0erne ofer hine ne lufige.\nHe gegl\u00e6ngde me mid orle of golde awefen, and mid ormettum mynum me gefretewode.\nHe \u00e6teowde me eac his \u00e6nlican hordas, \u00f0a he me gehet gif ic him gel\u00e6ste.\nNe m\u00e6g ic him to teonan o\u00f0erne geceosan, and hine forl\u00e6tan \u00fee me mid lufe beweddode.\nHis ansyn is wlitigre and his lufu wynsumre, his brydbedd me is gearo nu iu mid dreamum.\nHis m\u00e6denu me singa\u00f0 mid geswegum stemnum.\nOf his mu\u00f0e ic underfeng meoluc and hunig, nu iu ic eom beclypt mid his cl\u00e6num earmum.\nHis f\u00e6gera lichama is minum geferl\u00e6ht, and his blod geglende mine eahhringas.\nHis modor is m\u00e6den and his mihtiga f\u00e6der wifes ne breac, and him a buga\u00f0 englas.\nHis wlites wuldria\u00f0 \u00fea wynsumum tunglan, sunne and mona \u00fee middaneard onlihta\u00f0.\n\u00deurh his sp\u00e6c geedcucia\u00f0 eac \u00f0a deadan, and \u00feurh his hrepunge beo\u00f0 gestrangode \u00fea unstrangan\nHis speda ne ateoria\u00f0 ne his welan ne wania\u00f0.\n\u00deam anum ic healde minne truwan \u00e6fre, \u00feam ic me bef\u00e6ste mid ealre estfulnysse.\n\u00deonne ic hine lufige, ic beo eallunga cl\u00e6ne.\n\u00deonne Ic hine hreppe, ic beo unwemme.\n\u00d0onne Ic hine underfo, ic beo m\u00e6den for\u00f0, and \u00fe\u00e6r b\u00e6rn ne ateoria\u00f0 on \u00f0am brydlace.\n\u00de\u00e6r is eacnung buton sare and singallic w\u00e6stmb\u00e6rnyss.\nSe cniht wear\u00f0 geancsumod and wi\u00f0innan ablend \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6denes spr\u00e6ce, \u00fee hine spearn mid\nHe wear\u00f0 \u00fea gesicelod, and siccetunga teah of niwellicum breoste, on bedde licgende.\n\u00dea cunnodan l\u00e6cas hwi he licgende w\u00e6re, and cyddan \u00feam f\u00e6der \u00fe\u00e6s cnihtes modleaste.\n\u00dea sende se f\u00e6der sona to \u00f0am m\u00e6dene \u00fe\u00e6t ylce \u00e6rende \u00fee his sunu \u00e6r abead, ac Agnes wi\u00f0soc, s\u00e6de\n\u00dea \u00feuhte \u00f0am heahgerefan huxlic on mode \u00fe\u00e6t heo o\u00feerne tealde toforan his gebyrdum.\nBefran swa \u00feeah \u00feearle mid mycelre \u00f0rutunge hw\u00e6t se brydguma w\u00e6re \u00fee agnes onwuldrode.\nHim wear\u00f0 \u00fea ges\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t heo fram cildhade sona Cristen w\u00e6re, and swa mid drycr\u00e6fte afylled \u00fe\u00e6t heo\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a Simpronius mid swi\u00f0licum gehlyde, het hi gefeccan ham to his domsetle, and \u00e6rest\nAc \u00fe\u00e6t Godes m\u00e6den ne mihte beon bep\u00e6ht \u00feurh \u00e6nige lyffetunge fram hire leofan drihtne, ne heo n\u00e6s\n\u00dea geseah Sympronius hyre so\u00fean anr\u00e6dnysse, and cydde hire freondum \u00fe\u00e6t heo forscylgod w\u00e6re for\nEft \u00fe\u00e6s on mergen het se manfulla dema \u00fea eadigan Agnen him to gefeccan, and s\u00e6de hire gelome hu\nHe ges\u00e6t \u00fea his domsetl, dreorig on mode, and behet \u00f0am m\u00e6dene menigfealde wita buton heo wi\u00f0soce\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00e6ft si\u00f0\u00f0an to \u00f0am snoteran m\u00e6dene, Hlyst minum r\u00e6de, gif \u00f0u lufast meg\u00f0had, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u\nAgnes \u00f0a andwyrde \u00feam arleasan and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic forseah \u00feinne sunu \u00f0e so\u00felice is man, and ic nates\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se heahgerefa to \u00f0am halgan m\u00e6dene, Ic forb\u00e6r \u00fee o\u00f0 \u00feis for\u00f0an \u00fee \u00f0u gyt cild eart.\n\u00deu t\u00e6lst ure godas swa \u00feeah ne gr\u00e6ma \u00feu hi.\nAgnes him andwyrde, Se \u00e6lmihtiga hera\u00f0 swi\u00f0or manna mod \u00feonne heora mycclan ylde, and se\nL\u00e6t \u00feine godas geyrsian gif hi aht magon.\nL\u00e6t hi sylfe beodan \u00fe\u00e6t we us to him gebiddan, gif \u00feu \u00feis don ne miht, drece us, loca, hu \u00feu wylle.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Simpronius, se sceandlica dema, Geceos \u00fee nu, Agnes, an \u00fe\u00e6ra twegra; o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feu mid\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea Agnes andwyrde mid mycelre anr\u00e6dnysse, gif \u00f0u cu\u00f0est minne God, ne cw\u00e6de \u00feu \u00f0as word.\nOrsorhlice ic forseo \u00feine \u00feeowracan, for\u00fean \u00fee ic geare cann mines drihtnes mihte.\nIc truwige on him for\u00fean \u00f0e he is me trumweall and unateorigendlic bewerigend, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00f0inum\nIc h\u00e6bbe godes encgel haligne mid me.\n\u00deine godas syndon agotene of are of \u00feam \u00f0e man wyrc\u00f0 wynsume fate, O\u00f0\u00f0e hi synd st\u00e6nene mid\nNis na godes wunung on \u00f0am gr\u00e6gum stanum, ne on \u00e6renum wecgum, ac he wuna\u00f0 on heofonum.\n\u00dee so\u00f0lice genim\u00f0, and \u00feine gelican, seo grimlice hell mid \u00feam gr\u00e6digum fyre, on \u00feam ge beo\u00f0\n\u00dea het se woda dema hyre w\u00e6da of adon, and hi swa nacode gel\u00e6dan to \u00feam forligres huse, and het\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a Godes miht mycclum wear\u00f0 geswutelod, swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6denes fex befeng hi eall abutan\nHi tugon \u00f0a \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den to \u00fe\u00e6ra myltestrena huse, ac heo gemette \u00fe\u00e6r sona scinende Godes encgel,\nAgnes hi \u00fea astrehte \u00feone \u00e6lmihtigan biddende, and God hyre \u00fea asende scinende tunecan.\nHeo \u00feancode \u00f0a Criste, and \u00f0one cla\u00f0 hire onadyde, and w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e gem\u00e6te hire micelnysse, beorhte\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ra myltestrena hus mannum to geb\u00e6dhuse, and \u00e6lc se\u00f0e inneode arwur\u00f0ode God for \u00feam\n\u00dea com \u00fe\u00e6s gerefan suna to \u00fe\u00e6re scinendan stowe, mid his sceandlicum gegadum, wolde \u00fea godes\nAc hi wundrodon swi\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s wynsuman leohtes, and ablicgede cyrdon to heora bysmorfullum\n\u00dea \u00f0reade he hi \u00feearle for\u00f0an \u00fee hi \u00fe\u00e6s scinendan leohtes swa swi\u00f0e wundrodon, and hi gewemman\nArn \u00fea him sylf inn mid sceandlicum willan, ac he feol astreht \u00e6tforan \u00feam m\u00e6dene adyd, \u00feurh \u00f0one\nHe l\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6r swa d\u00e6d lange on \u00fe\u00e6re flora.\n\u00d0a wendon his gegadan \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re gebysgod embe his fracedan d\u00e6da, \u00fea fandode heora an, and\n\u00dea arn seo burhwaru ablycged \u00feider sona, and se f\u00e6der eac com, clypigende mid gehlyde, \u00feu\nAgnes him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Hwi synd \u00fea o\u00f0re cuce \u00fee hider inneodon, buton for\u00f0on \u00fee hi arwur\u00f0odon \u00feone\n\u00dein sceamleasa sunu mid sceamleasum anginne arn into me, ac se encgel hine afylde, and \u00f0am deofle\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se heahgerefa to \u00f0am halgan m\u00e6dene, \u00fein saga bi\u00f0 geswutelod gif \u00feu \u00feone sylfan encgel\nAgnes seo eadige him andwyrde \u00feus, Ne synd ge na wyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t wundor to geseonne, ac swa \u00feeah is\nGa\u00f0 eow nu \u00feeah ealle ut, \u00fe\u00e6t ic me ana gebidde.\nHi eodon \u00fea ealle ut, and heo hi ana geb\u00e6d, biddende hire drihten \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feone deadan ar\u00e6rde.\n\u00dea \u00e6teowde \u00fe\u00e6r Cristes encgel, and \u00feone cniht ar\u00e6rde.\nAnd he arn \u00fe\u00e6rrihte ut, \u00fea he geedcucod w\u00e6s, clypigende ofer eall, and cw\u00e6\u00f0ende \u00feus, An God is on\nHi ne magon him sylfum fremian, ne o\u00f0rum fultumian.\n\u00dea wurdon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0engyldan hetelice gedrefede, and clypodon mid gehlyde be \u00f0am geleaffullan\n\u00dea ne dorste se heahgerefa naht ongean \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0engyldan, ac forlet his gingran togeanes \u00fe\u00e6re ceaste,\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea Aspasius se undergerefa ne mihte wi\u00f0cw\u00e6\u00f0an \u00feam cwealmb\u00e6rum folce, ac het \u00fea ontendan\nHit wear\u00f0 \u00fea swa gedon, swa se w\u00e6lhreowa het, ac se lig hine tod\u00e6lde on twegen d\u00e6las sona, and\nAnd Agnes seo eadige stod on \u00e6lemiddan gesund, astr\u00e6htum handum \u00feus hi gebiddende, Eala \u00f0u\nEfne ic eom begoten mid godcundlicum deawe, \u00fe\u00e6s lig is tod\u00e6led and \u00fea geleafleasan forsw\u00e6lede.\nIc bletsige \u00f0e f\u00e6der bodigendlic God, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00feurh fyr unforht to \u00f0e faran mot.\n\u00de\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t ic gelyfde \u00fe\u00e6t ic geseo, \u00f0\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t ic gehihte, \u00fe\u00e6t ic h\u00e6bbe nu.\n\u00dee Ic andette mid mu\u00f0e and mid minre heortan, and mid eallum inno\u00f0e ic \u00fee gewilnige, \u00e6nne so\u00f0ne\n\u00de\u00e6t fyr wear\u00f0 \u00fea acwenced, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r an col ne gleow, and \u00fe\u00e6t folc tealde \u00fe\u00e6t to drycr\u00e6fte,\n\u00d0a ne mihte Aspasius \u00fea micclan ceaste acuman, ac het hi acwellan mid cwealmb\u00e6rum swurde, and\nSe f\u00e6der and seo modor mid mycelre blysse, gel\u00e6hton hyre lic and gel\u00e6ddon to heora agenum, and hi\n\u00dea on sumere nihte gesawon hi cuman mycel m\u00e6denlic werod, and Agnes tomiddes.\nHi w\u00e6ron ealle geglengede mid gyldenum gyrlum, and mid orm\u00e6tum leohte arwur\u00f0lice ferdon.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 seo halige Agnes to hire magum \u00f0us, Warnia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ge ne wepon me swa swa deade, ac\nIc eom \u00feysum m\u00e6denum geferl\u00e6ht, and ic mid him underfeng swi\u00f0e f\u00e6gere wununga, and \u00f0am ic\n\u00c6fter \u00feysum wordum heo gewende for\u00f0 mid \u00feam m\u00e6denum.\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 \u00feeos gesih\u00fe swi\u00f0e gewidm\u00e6rsod.\nHit gelamp \u00f0a si\u00f0\u00f0an \u00e6fter lytlum fyrste, on \u00fe\u00e6s caseres dagum \u00fee Constantinus hatte, \u00fe\u00e6t sume\nHeo w\u00e6s swa \u00feeah snotor, and swy\u00f0e unhal, and on eallum limum egeslice wunda h\u00e6fde.\n\u00dea \u00f0ohte heo \u00fe\u00e6t heo wolde wacian ane niht \u00e6t Agnes byrgene, biddan hire h\u00e6le.\nHeo com \u00fea \u00feider \u00feeah \u00fee heo h\u00e6\u00f0en w\u00e6re, and mid geleaffullum mode to \u00f0am m\u00e6dene clypode \u00fee\nHeo wear\u00f0 \u00fea on sl\u00e6pe and on swefne geseah \u00fea eadigan Agnen, \u00feas word hire secgende, Ongin\n\u00dea awoc Constantia and w\u00e6s swa geh\u00e6led \u00fe\u00e6t on hire lice n\u00e6s gesyne aht \u00fe\u00e6ra sarra wunda.\nHeo ferde \u00f0a hal ham to hire f\u00e6der, and hine geblyssode and hire gebro\u00f0ra, and ealle \u00f0a hiredmenn for\nHeo wear\u00f0 \u00fea gefullod swa swa hire f\u00e6der w\u00e6s, and hadunga underfeng mid f\u00e6gere drohtnunga.\nAnd manega o\u00f0re m\u00e6denu \u00feurh hire m\u00e6rlican gebysnunga forsawon woruldlustas and wurdon Criste\n\u00d0a b\u00e6d Constantia Constantinum hire f\u00e6der \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6re eadigan Agne ane cyrcan ar\u00e6rde, and hire\n\u00dees hlisa asprang \u00fea on eallum \u00f0am leodscipe, and coman fela untrume to \u00fe\u00e6re halgan byrigene, and\n\u00dea Romaniscan m\u00e6denu manega eac \u00f0urhwunodon on cl\u00e6num m\u00e6g\u00f0hade for Cristes lufe, \u00e6fter\nALIA SENTENTIA QUAM SCRIPSIT TERRENTIANVS.\nON \u00d0AM DAGUM W\u00e6S SVM HERETOGA GEHATEN GALlicanus, sigef\u00e6st on gefeohtum, and\nSe awogode Constantian \u00fe\u00e6s caseres dohtor on \u00fe\u00e6re tide \u00fee \u00f0a Scy\u00f0iscan swi\u00f0e wunnon wi\u00f0 hine.\nWear\u00f0 \u00fea se casere for \u00fe\u00e6re wogunge astyrod, wiste \u00fe\u00e6t seo dohtor, \u00fee drihten h\u00e6fde gecoren, hra\u00f0or\n\u00dea geseah seo dohtor hire f\u00e6der gedrefednysse, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 him \u00f0us to mid cl\u00e6num ingehyde, Ic wat\nAwurp \u00feine ymbhydignysse, and behat me \u00feam heretogan, \u00fe\u00e6t he me underfo \u00e6fter \u00f0am gefeohte,\nFor \u00feysum behate, ic wille habban his dohtra Attican and Arthemian to minre ge\u00feeodnysse, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t\nH\u00e6bbe he mid him for\u00f0 to \u00fe\u00e6re fyrdincge Iohannem and Paulum, mine \u00f0a getreowostan, \u00fe\u00e6t hi mine\nHit wear\u00f0 swa gedon, \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00f0a dohtra underfeng, and se heretoga ferde mid \u00fe\u00e6re fyrdincge.\n\u00dea geb\u00e6d Constantia hi to Gode sona mid mycelre onbryrdnysse \u00fe\u00e6t he hire bena gehyrde, Eala \u00f0u\nGeopena heora heortan earan to \u00fe\u00e6re halwendan lare, \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00fee anne lufian, and eor\u00f0lice \u00f0ing ne\n\u00c6fter \u00feysum gebede gebugon \u00f0a m\u00e6denu to \u00f0am halgan fulluhte \u00e6r se f\u00e6der come, and wurdon\n\u00dea com Gallicanus eac to gode gebogen, and hine geb\u00e6d sona mid so\u00f0um geleafan \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s halgan\nHine wylcumede se casere, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 him to mid blysse, \u00fea \u00f0a \u00feu to \u00feam gefeohte ferdest \u00feu\n\u00dea aleat Gallicanus to \u00f0am geleaffullan casere, and s\u00e6de be endebyrdnysse hu he beah to Gode, \u00fea\n\u00dea offrode Ic gelome mine lac \u00feam godum, o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t mine geferan me and hi bet\u00e6hton \u00f0am\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00f0a cristenan, Iohannes and Paulus, Behat \u00feam heofonlicum Gode \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u to him gebuge,\nIc \u00f0a sona behet, swa swa \u00fea halgan me tihton, and me com \u00fe\u00e6rrihte to Godes encgel mid rode, het\nIc him fyligde \u00f0a, and fela englas coman on manna gelicnyssum, m\u00e6rlice gew\u00e6pnode, gehyrton me\nHe feoll \u00f0a afyrht to minum fotum astreht.\n\u00dea gebundon \u00f0a Godes cempan Bardan \u00feone cynincg and his tw\u00e6gen suna, and bet\u00e6hton hi me.\nNe sloh ic n\u00e6nne, ne ofslean ne het.\nNu is \u00fein land gehealden and \u00fea leoda \u00fee onbuga\u00f0.\nEalle \u00f0a heafodmenn \u00fee to me gebugan, mid heora cempum, ic gebigde to Criste; \u00f0a o\u00f0re ic forseah \u00fee\nIc sylf eom swa Cristen \u00fe\u00e6t ic gecw\u00e6\u00f0 on behate \u00fe\u00e6t ic heonanfor\u00f0 nelle habban wifes gemanan.\nFind me nu \u00e6ftergencgan, \u00fe\u00e6t ic Gode m\u00e6ge \u00feeowian on so\u00f0re \u00e6wf\u00e6stnysse swa ic \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan\n\u00dea beclypte se casere \u00f0one Godes cempan, and s\u00e6de hu his dohtra drihtne \u00feeowdon, and his twa\n\u00dea eodon hi to healle, and seo halige Helena com mid \u00f0am fores\u00e6dum m\u00e6denum, micclum\nHi \u00feurhwunodon on m\u00e6g\u00f0hade, m\u00e6rlice drohtniende, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hi gewiton of worulde to Criste.\nGallicanus \u00fea freode fif \u00feusend manna, and mid \u00e6htum gewelgode and w\u00e6dlum tod\u00e6lde his\nFeower land he forgeaf for\u00f0 in mid him, \u00e6l\u00feeodigum to andfencge and to \u00e6lmesd\u00e6dum.\n\u00dea asprang his word wide geond land, hu se m\u00e6re man manna fet a\u00f0woh, and w\u00e6ter b\u00e6r to handum,\nHe wear\u00f0 \u00f0a swa halig \u00fe\u00e6t he geh\u00e6lde untrume, and swa hra\u00f0e swa he beseah on \u00f0a witseocan menn,\nEft \u00f0a \u00fea Iulianus, se arleasa wi\u00f0ers\u00e6ce, wear\u00f0 to casere gecoren, \u00feeah \u00fee he w\u00e6re to preoste\n\u00dea sette